Skills: Docker

Purpose:
  Docker skills organized by competency layers.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @L1-fundamentals.sdd
   3  @L2-multi-stage-builds.sdd
   4  @L3-kubernetes.sdd
   5  @L4-enterprise-registry.sdd

Modes:
  LEARN    — learn Docker fundamentals
  APPLY    — apply Docker patterns to containers
  REVIEW   — review Docker skills
  UPGRADE  — propose Docker skill upgrade

Rules:
  [D1]  Use specific image versions, not latest.
  [D2]  Minimize layers and image size.
  [D3]  Run as non-root user.
  [D4]  Scan images for vulnerabilities.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    L1-fundamentals.sdd

  Resolve:
    L1-fundamentals
    L2-multi-stage-builds
    L3-kubernetes
    L4-enterprise-registry

